\[
Q^2 = E_f^2 - 2(E_f E_i /c^2 - p_f \cdot p_i) + E_i^2
\]

Rearranging terms:

\[
Q^2 = E_f^2 + E_i^2 - 2E_f E_i /c^2 + 2p_f \cdot p_i
\]

